OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste processing is 'worth
OL,4,Athe extra effort'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnderstanding the benefits of recycling
OL,7,Ffood waste could encourage more people
OL,8,Fto do it in future, Cornwall Council
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FFor the past two years, leftover food
OL,12,Fhas been able to be taken to an
OL,13,Fanaerobic digester to be converted into
OL,14,Fmethane to generate electricity and
OL,15,Fproduce fertiliser.
OL,17,FThe council said about 36,000 tonnes of
OL,18,Ffood waste had been recycled to date
OL,19,Fsince the introduction of its new waste
OL,20,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
