OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste processing is 'worth
OL,4,Athe extra effort'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it hoped increased
OL,7,Fparticipation through understanding the
OL,8,Fbenefits would help meet its target to
OL,9,Frecycle nearly two-thirds of Cornwall's
OL,10,Fwaste by 2029.
